sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer (An)
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as API
    participant D as Database
    C->>W: Choose car, dealership, service
    W->>A: Which days are free this month?
    A->>D: Read taken slots (one query)
    A-->>W: Days: free / fully booked / past
    C->>W: Pick tomorrow, then 10:00
    W->>A: Who would serve this booking?
    A-->>W: Lan (EV technician) and Bay 3
    C->>W: Click "Book appointment"
    W->>A: POST booking (with Idempotency-Key)
    A->>D: Save appointment + slot rows (one transaction)
    D-->>A: Saved
    A-->>W: 201 Created: Lan, Bay 3, 10:00–11:00
    W-->>C: "You're booked"
